{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おととい昨日と撮影ありました。\n今日は昼まで寝たから元気さ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/10/0390093/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーがブログで実況中継して\nくれてたところに私のことも\n書いてあったけど、\nきゃっきゃしてました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/10/0390093/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きゃっきゃ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"*****HaPPy BirThDAy*****"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かずみ♡2013.2.8"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日休憩中にさゆにゃんと黒板に\nバースデーメッセージ書いたの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/10/0390093/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かずみさんオチがありそうな話\nしてくるのにいつの間にか\n終わってることがあるんだよ笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでもおもしろいんだよー\n私だったら絶対シラケるのに"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/10/0390093/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、みなさん知らないと思うけど\n初期から私のこと\nおばあちゃん扱いなんだよ←\n「ほら、まりか60歳だから」\nって適当にあしらうわけですよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりっかは童顔"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/10/0390093/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"！！！←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいまいと休憩中に\n人中ブラックホールって技考えたけど\nかずみに見せたら笑ってくれたら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...うん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よしとしよう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しかしまいまい...\n人中ビームのこと書いてなかったな。\nそれも考えたのに笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ま～りっか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/10/0390093/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/10/0390093/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/10/0390093/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/10/0390093/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼アメイジング／\nかずみおめでとう！だいすき"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/10/0390093/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"............"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/10/0390093/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さっき一人映画観てきました！\n「AKB48ドキュメンタリー」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"比べものにならない。\nちっちゃい私たちだ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今度ミニシアター行こう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/10/0390093/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんが最近観た映画\n教えてください"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/10/0390093/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}